  <p class="fine">Normalises what the provider sent into the columns the engine
  reads and writes it to <code>data/connected/aws-cloudwatch-utilisation/</code>. Nothing is
  computed and nothing is guessed: a row that cannot be dated is dropped rather
  than placed in the wrong month.</p>
